literal	cannot write output: {error}	console write failure text in bn_interp and bn_rt; leaves with the console core
literal	datagram exceeds the buffer	Net operation name or message in bn_host_net and bn_llvm/bn_rt; leaves with the Net core
literal	write exceeds the buffer	Net operation name or message in bn_host_net and bn_llvm/bn_rt; leaves with the Net core
